title: "Computational Physics Workbench"
abstract: >-
  A local-first, agent-operated and human-reviewed research workbench for
  computational and theoretical physics. It provides traceable research
  planning, workflow execution, evidence review, reusable experience, and
  bounded local or HPC operations. DFT+DMFT is the first integrated use case,
  not the boundary of the system.
